# CATV roles

Roles are ADMIN, DISTRIBUTOR, OPERATOR, and CUSTOMER.

ADMIN has exactly three types, stored as `adminType` (required when role is ADMIN, null otherwise):

1. DEVELOPER — Developer
2. SUPERADMIN — Super Admin
3. ADMIN — Admin

All three admin types currently have full Admin access and see the whole network. Do not invent a permission split between them until the product owner defines one.

Distributors see their own subtree. Operators see their own customers. Customers see themselves. Enforce this in the shared data-scope layer.
